{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888240/extras/c3ab0d4eb9a32ab924f26800bf35afad.avif?t=1758814806\" width=628 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls are simple\u2014just up, down, left, and right! ...And surprisingly deep!?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888240/extras/033cae40991480e4c6d5a0d75430b794.poster.avif?t=1758814806\" width=270 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888240/extras/033cae40991480e4c6d5a0d75430b794.webm?t=1758814806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888240/extras/033cae40991480e4c6d5a0d75430b794.mp4?t=1758814806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blocks placed whenever the player's cursor moves disappear when they match the color of other blocks. In the original rules, clearing the game requires destroying all the colorful blocks placed at the start!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Versus Mode (2P)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Versus Mode, you can choose between player vs. player battles and battles against the CPU.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a Star<br>Break the star blocks. The first player to break five star blocks wins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original<br>Similar to 1P mode, clearing the game requires destroying all the colorful blocks placed at the start.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra Fight Da! Kyanta 2 characters \u201cDr. Kyanta\u201d and \u201cMasako\u201d dance on screen!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upbeat BGM by composer tdhr!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three difficulty levels\u2014\u201cEASY,\u201d \u201cNORMAL,\u201d and \u201cHARD\u201d\u2014to play!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guidelines for Streaming and Video Posting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to stream gameplay videos and post videos, whether for profit or not. We would greatly appreciate it if you could include a link to the game's Steam store page in the description section of your videos or streams. Monetization on platforms such as YouTube and Twitch is also permitted.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3888240?t=1758814806","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3888240?t=1758814806","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888240/2292d82f50d91c14359656d425a2c17a1dcff6f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758814806","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888240/2292d82f50d91c14359656d425a2c17a1dcff6f1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758814806","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888240/extras/c3ab0d4eb9a32ab924f26800bf35afad.avif?t=1758814806\" width=628 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls are simple\u2014just up, down, left, and right! ...And surprisingly deep!?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888240/extras/033cae40991480e4c6d5a0d75430b794.poster.avif?t=1758814806\" width=270 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888240/extras/033cae40991480e4c6d5a0d75430b794.webm?t=1758814806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888240/extras/033cae40991480e4c6d5a0d75430b794.mp4?t=1758814806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blocks placed whenever the player's cursor moves disappear when they match the color of other blocks. In the original rules, clearing the game requires destroying all the colorful blocks placed at the start!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Versus Mode (2P)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Versus Mode, you can choose between player vs. player battles and battles against the CPU.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a Star<br>Break the star blocks. The first player to break five star blocks wins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original<br>Similar to 1P mode, clearing the game requires destroying all the colorful blocks placed at the start.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra Fight Da! Kyanta 2 characters \u201cDr. Kyanta\u201d and \u201cMasako\u201d dance on screen!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upbeat BGM by composer tdhr!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three difficulty levels\u2014\u201cEASY,\u201d \u201cNORMAL,\u201d and \u201cHARD\u201d\u2014to play!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guidelines for Streaming and Video Posting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to stream gameplay videos and post videos, whether for profit or not. We would greatly appreciate it if you could include a link to the game's Steam store page in the description section of your videos or streams. Monetization on platforms such as YouTube and Twitch is also permitted.</p>","developers":["\u7fbd\u826f\u9ebb\u30bb\u30eb\u30d5"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888240/ec1506faa00b6e766de90b10bfc9a7cfd93c09b1/header.jpg?t=1758814806","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3888240/43472027/ea9bb2deb849c165eba1333851389520202243b2/1758813142/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758814804","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3888240/43472027/ea9bb2deb849c165eba1333851389520202243b2/1758813142/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758814804","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3888240/43472027/ea9bb2deb849c165eba1333851389520202243b2/1758813142/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758814804","id":257195841,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195841/movie480.mp4?t=1758814804","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195841/movie_max.mp4?t=1758814804"},"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257195841/8084ff2210a7f1e6fe6b1b11a1f94633f383e90b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758814804","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195841/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1758814804","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195841/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1758814804"}}],"name":"Dr. KYANTA","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Mi